GET {{host}}/dev/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDev.response.body.$.token}}

### T48 request log (latest 50)
# Should be 200 newest first.
GET {{host}}/dev/request-log?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDev.response.body.$.token}}

