# Should be 200, every entry has status 404 (run T15 ก่อน)
GET {{host}}/dev/request-log?status=404
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDev.response.body.$.token}}

### T50 request log: all 4xx, newest 5
# Should be 200, at most 5 entries, all with status (Txx ก่อนหน้า appear)
GET {{host}}/dev/request-log?status=4xx&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDev.response.body.$.token}}

### T51 dev tries an admin endpoint
# Should be 403 "Access denied: Admin role required"
GET {{host}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDev.response.body.$.token}}

